requisito tablero_ca9f1ed71bc00602b.el_tablero_dice_a_quien_necesita:
    texto "Tipo: funcional The system SHALL label a pending human decision of a change held by another person as decided by that person, and keep labelling it as needing the viewer when the change has no holder or the viewer holds it."
